        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876840/extras/66d27386fec46e0b052941957d9bdc22.webp?t=1759335052\" width=38 height=38 /></span> <strong>Defend Your Base</strong> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876840/extras/66d27386fec46e0b052941957d9bdc22.webp?t=1759335052\" width=38 height=38 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last bastion.  Stand strong against monsters and ghouls as they carry out a full-out attack to destroy your base. Survive long enough to acquire candies, obtain powerups, and protect your base from destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876840/extras/0a78b71c181d9213dc6b361ddf18a4d6.webp?t=1759335052\" width=32 height=32 /></span><strong>Two Ways To Play</strong> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876840/extras/0a78b71c181d9213dc6b361ddf18a4d6.webp?t=1759335052\" width=32 height=32 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Campaign Mode:</strong></u> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through 9 unique campaign levels, each with their own twists and challenges to conquer.  Do you have what it takes to break the curse once and for all.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Survival Mode:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight endlessly against monsters and ghouls while obtaining new powerups and curses every few rounds. How long will you hold out for before the monsters overtake your base?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wield the power of the elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876840/extras/df46c234218905d1347b659dbb88ea89.avif?t=1759335052\" width=64 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876840/extras/a6dde4618f0054d53b94715e9f7ea5b0.avif?t=1759335052\" width=64 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876840/extras/4759597f8e0c4afc69e7d4cad87b07f5.avif?t=1759335052\" width=64 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876840/extras/f3bbbd78ce384225a557677bce663783.avif?t=1759335052\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give yourself an edge in battle by harnessing the power of the elements to your advantage. Magic-imbued crystals can be unlocked to powerup your saw during combat, letting you slice through the incoming monsters with ease. If you see a crystal appear, destroy it with your saw and watch the magic unfold. Try stacking multiple elements on top of each other to create devastating combinations! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876840/extras/3035c9d7f30df1d5f85c43bcdca0b3a7.webp?t=1759335052\" width=32 height=32 /></span> <strong>Earn Rewards &amp; Customize</strong> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876840/extras/3035c9d7f30df1d5f85c43bcdca0b3a7.webp?t=1759335052\" width=32 height=32 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you earn achievements in Sawmania, you will be rewarded with a bonus currency that you may redeem in the <i>Trades &amp; Offers</i> store in exchange for miscellaneous cosmetic items. These allow you to customize your gameplay experience by equipping any combination of launchers, saw skins, and particle trails. The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876840/extras/5590beda50e8bec68f60b1b5f7159aad.avif?t=1759335052\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876840/extras/66d27386fec46e0b052941957d9bdc22.webp?t=1759335052\" width=38 height=38 /></span> <strong>Defend Your Base</strong> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876840/extras/66d27386fec46e0b052941957d9bdc22.webp?t=1759335052\" width=38 height=38 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last bastion.  Stand strong against monsters and ghouls as they carry out a full-out attack to destroy your base. Survive long enough to acquire candies, obtain powerups, and protect your base from destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876840/extras/0a78b71c181d9213dc6b361ddf18a4d6.webp?t=1759335052\" width=32 height=32 /></span><strong>Two Ways To Play</strong> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876840/extras/0a78b71c181d9213dc6b361ddf18a4d6.webp?t=1759335052\" width=32 height=32 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Campaign Mode:</strong></u> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through 9 unique campaign levels, each with their own twists and challenges to conquer.  Do you have what it takes to break the curse once and for all.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Survival Mode:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight endlessly against monsters and ghouls while obtaining new powerups and curses every few rounds. How long will you hold out for before the monsters overtake your base?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wield the power of the elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876840/extras/df46c234218905d1347b659dbb88ea89.avif?t=1759335052\" width=64 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876840/extras/a6dde4618f0054d53b94715e9f7ea5b0.avif?t=1759335052\" width=64 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876840/extras/4759597f8e0c4afc69e7d4cad87b07f5.avif?t=1759335052\" width=64 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876840/extras/f3bbbd78ce384225a557677bce663783.avif?t=1759335052\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give yourself an edge in battle by harnessing the power of the elements to your advantage. Magic-imbued crystals can be unlocked to powerup your saw during combat, letting you slice through the incoming monsters with ease. If you see a crystal appear, destroy it with your saw and watch the magic unfold. Try stacking multiple elements on top of each other to create devastating combinations! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876840/extras/3035c9d7f30df1d5f85c43bcdca0b3a7.webp?t=1759335052\" width=32 height=32 /></span> <strong>Earn Rewards &amp; Customize</strong> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876840/extras/3035c9d7f30df1d5f85c43bcdca0b3a7.webp?t=1759335052\" width=32 height=32 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you earn achievements in Sawmania, you will be rewarded with a bonus currency that you may redeem in the <i>Trades &amp; Offers</i> store in exchange for miscellaneous cosmetic items. These allow you to customize your gameplay experience by equipping any combination of launchers, saw skins, and particle trails. The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876840/extras/5590beda50e8bec68f60b1b5f7159aad.avif?t=1759335052\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
